  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar to train your level 20 ranks. Sorek is in the Valley of Honor, Searn Firewarder in the Valley of Wisdom.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  train class
  accept 1823 only Warrior            -- Sorek
  accept 1528 only Shaman             -- Searn Firewarder

step Gan'rul Bloodeye
  only Warlock
  tip The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength.
  accept 1507                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  turnin 1507                         -- Cazul, a few steps away
  accept 1508
  turnin 1508                         -- Zankaja, Valley of Strength
  accept 1509

step Shenthul
  only Rogue
  tip Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Target him and type /salute to finish The Shattered Salute.
  accept 2460
  complete 2460
  turnin 2460
  accept 2458                         -- Deep Cover: Taskmaster Fizzule, by the Sludge Fen

step Ur'kyo
  only Priest
  tip Ur'kyo stands in the Valley of Spirits, on the city's west side.
  accept 5680 only Troll              -- Ur'kyo
  turnin 5680 only Troll              -- Ur'kyo: Shadowguard
  accept 5646 only Undead             -- Ur'kyo: Aelthalyste in the Undercity, two guides on

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff and train your level 20 ranks: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

