# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sludge Fen

step Strange Lockbox
  only Tauren,Druid
  tip The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility for Trial of the Sea Lion.
  collect 15883

step Ignition
  tip East to the Sludge Fen. Wizzlecrank's Shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key.
  accept 858
  collect 5050 quest 858.1
  turnin 858
  accept 863

step The Escape
  tip Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet.
  complete 863

step Taskmaster Fizzule
  only Rogue
  tip Fizzule runs the Venture Co. camp at the east end of the Sludge Fen. He attacks strangers: target him and /salute before he does.
  turnin 2458
  accept 2478 optional

step Mission: Possible But Not Probable
  only Rogue
  tip Stay stealthed: Foreman Silixiz carries the key to the tower; Gallywix and his lockbox are at the top. Gallywix is elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 54.8,5.6 "Venture Co. tower" optional
  collect 8072 quest 2478.5 optional
  kill 7310 quest 2478.1 optional
  kill 7308 quest 2478.3 optional
  kill 7307 quest 2478.2 optional
  collect 8073 quest 2478.6 optional
  collect 8074 quest 2478.4 optional

step Boulder Lode Mine
  tip The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald.
  collect 5097 quest 896.1

step Hearth to the Crossroads
