  turnin 876                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger
  turnin 6128 only Tauren,Druid       -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6129 only Tauren,Druid       -- He gives you the Curative Animal Salve

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: Verog, Camp Taurajo, the Bristlebacks

