  collect 5023 quest 851.1
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1 only Tauren,Druid -- Sickly Gazelle: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam the plains all around the Crossroads

step Camp Taurajo
  tip Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo.
  getfp "Camp Taurajo" npc 10378      -- Omusa Thunderhorn
