step Bristleback camps
  tip The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Every Bristleback drops a tusk; Mankrik's wife lies at the north edge. Keep one Blood Shard. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest.
