# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Field of Giants
  tip South of Camp Taurajo the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head.
  collect 5058 quest 868.1
  collect 5138 optional               -- Harvester's Head
  accept 897 optional

step Gann Stonespire
  tip Gann waits in a small camp further south, on the road toward Bael Modan.
  accept 843
  accept 98093 @47.8,77.6             -- Sulhasa, up in the tree just east of Gann
  turnin 1530 only Shaman             -- Brine, just west of Gann
  accept 1535 only Shaman
  collect 7769 quest 1535.1 only Shaman @44.3,76.8 -- Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the quilboar watering hole
  turnin 1535 only Shaman
  accept 1536 only Shaman             -- Keep it: the Spring Well is beside Tarren Mill

step Blackthorn Ridge
  tip West of Gann, the Razormane hold Blackthorn Ridge. Kuz is on the east side, Nak to the south, Lok Orcbane at the west end. Lok (25) and the Warfrenzies (24-25) are a few levels above you; Hagg Taurenbane, a rare elite, sometimes walks the ridge: leave him. Pathfinders and Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzies the War Shield. Stormhide lizards and Hecklefang Stalkers roam the plain between Gann and the ridge. Washte Pawne, a rare red wind serpent, flies over the ridge: its feather starts a quest.
  goto 42.5,81.0 "Blackthorn Ridge"
  collect 5074 quest 879.1
  collect 5073 quest 879.2
  collect 5072 quest 879.3
  collect 5093 quest 893.1
  collect 5092 quest 893.2
  collect 5094 quest 893.3
