step The Stormrage Barrow Dens
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Tauren: the Great Cat Spirit waits on the southern hill above the bridge. Skyborne: the Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of the twin bridges. Then the dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue.
  turnin 98405 only Tauren            -- Great Cat Spirit
